WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:10.009
&gt;&gt;&gt; A SAN FRANCISCO COURT JUST
RELEASED THE AUDIO AND RECORDING

00:00:10.009 --> 00:00:13.580
FROM THE ATTACK ON PAUL PELOSI.
THE BODY CAM VIDEO SHOWS THE

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:18.685
MOMENT THAT THE ATTACKER STRIKES
PAUL PELOSI WITH A HAMMER, JUST

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:21.387
MOMENTS AFTER POLICE RESPONDED
TO THE PELOSI HOME.

00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:25.358
PAUL PELOSI WAS ASLEEP IN BED
WHEN THE SUSPECT BROKE IN, AND

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:28.261
WE WARN YOU, THIS VIDEO IS
DISTURBING.

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:46.880
[ KNOCKING ]
&gt;&gt; 2620, RIGHT?

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.081
&gt;&gt; 2640.
&gt;&gt; OH.

00:00:48.081 --> 00:00:50.850
&gt;&gt; YEAH.
HOW YOU DOING?

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.318
&gt;&gt; HOW ARE YOU?
&gt;&gt; WHAT'S GOING ON, MAN?

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:55.088
&gt;&gt; EVERYTHING IS GOOD.
&gt;&gt; ALL RIGHT.

00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:57.423
&gt;&gt; DROP THE HAMMER.
&gt;&gt; NOPE.

00:00:57.423 --> 00:00:59.959
&gt;&gt; HEY, HEY.
&gt;&gt; WHAT IS GOING ON RIGHT NOW?

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:14.140
&gt;&gt; WHOA.

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:24.884
&gt;&gt; BACKUP, CODE 3.
&gt;&gt; BEFORE THE ATTACK, PAUL

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:30.490
PELOSI HAD CALLED 911.
AND THAT AUDIO WAS ALSO JUST

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:32.692
RELEASED.
CNN'S REPORTER IS LIVE IN SAN

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:36.729
FRANCISCO FOR US.
TELL US WHAT YOU HAVE LEARNED.

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:39.232
&gt;&gt; Reporter: ALISON, SO MANY
DISTURBING DETAILS NOW THAT WE

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:42.669
ARE FINALLY SEEING AND HEARING
EXACTLY WHAT PLAYED OUT.

00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:45.805
BUT WE HEARD ABOUT ALL THIS IN A
MOTION DETAINED.

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:48.975
IT IS ENTIRELY DIFFERENT TO
WATCH IT FOR YOURSELF.

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:52.145
IN AN INTERVIEW WITH
INVESTIGATORS, DAVID DePAPE

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:55.715
WALKS THROUGH EVERY SINGLE STEP
OF WHAT HE DID AND HIS INTENT.

00:01:55.715 --> 00:02:00.620
IT REVEALS THAT AFTER HE HAD
WOKEN PAUL PELOSI UP AND THEY

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:03.423
HAD A BRIEF CONVERSATION ABOUT
WHAT HE WAS THERE TO DO, WHICH

00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:07.060
DAVID DePAPE ADMITS TO WANTING
TO HOLD NANCY PELOSI HOSTAGE,

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:10.964
PAUL IS ABLE TO GET INTO THE
BATHROOM, WHERE HE IS ABLE TO

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:14.467
MAKE A 911 CALL, WHICH HE IS
TRYING TO CONVEY TO THE

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:17.303
DISPATCHER THAT SOMETHING IS
WRONG, WITHOUT GIVING IT AWAY.

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:26.512
SO TAKE A LISTEN FOR YOURSELF.
&gt;&gt; THIS IS SAN FRANCISCO POLICE.

00:02:26.512 --> 00:02:41.861
DO YOU NEED HELP?
&gt;&gt; HE'S WAITING FOR MY WIFE,

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:46.733
NANCY PELOSI, TO COME BACK.
&gt;&gt; DO YOU NEED POLICE, FIRE, OR

00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:54.874
MEDICAL FOR ANYTHING.
&gt;&gt; I DON'T THINK SO.

00:02:54.874 --> 00:03:07.153
I DON'T THINK SO.
IS THE CAPITOL POLICE AROUND?

00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:11.424
&gt;&gt; NO, THIS IS SAN FRANCISCO.
&gt;&gt; THEY'RE USUALLY HERE AT THE

00:03:11.424 --> 00:03:12.792
HOUSE.
&gt;&gt; NO, THIS IS SAN FRANCISCO

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:23.836
POLICE.
&gt;&gt; NO, I UNDERSTAND.

00:03:23.836 --> 00:03:33.413
&gt;&gt; OKAY.
UMM, I'VE GOT A PROBLEM.

00:03:33.413 --> 00:03:36.215
BUT HE SAYS EVERYTHING IS GOOD.
&gt;&gt; OKAY.

00:03:36.215 --> 00:03:39.251
CALL US BACK IF YOU NEED US.
&gt;&gt; NO, NO.

00:03:39.251 --> 00:03:44.090
THIS GENTLEMAN JUST CAME INTO
THE HOUSE AND HE WANTS TO WAIT

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:49.295
FOR MY WIFE TO COME HOME.
AND SO -- ANY WAY --

00:03:49.295 --> 00:03:51.197
&gt;&gt; DO YOU KNOW WHO THE PERSON
IS?

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:59.372
&gt;&gt; NO, I DON'T KNOW WHO HE IS.
HE HAS -- HE SAID HE IS TELLING

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:02.275
ME NOT TO DO ANYTHING.
WHAT IS IS YOUR ADDRESS, SIR?

00:04:02.275 --> 00:04:11.417
[ BLEEP ]
WHAT IS YOUR NAME?

00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:21.961
&gt;&gt; MY NAME IS PAUL PELOSI.
THIS GENTLEMAN SAYS THAT --

00:04:21.961 --> 00:04:26.499
[ INAUDIBLE ]
OKAY.

00:04:26.499 --> 00:04:33.206
&gt;&gt; WHAT'S THE GENTLEMAN'S NAME?
&gt;&gt; MY NAME IS DAVID.

00:04:33.206 --> 00:04:35.108
&gt;&gt; HIS NAME IS DAVID.
&gt;&gt; OKAY.

00:04:35.108 --> 00:04:38.911
WHO IS DAVID?
&gt;&gt; I DON'T KNOW.

00:04:38.911 --> 00:04:40.913
WHAT'S THAT?
&gt;&gt; I'M A FRIEND OF THEIRS.

00:04:40.913 --> 00:04:46.652
&gt;&gt; YEAH, HE SAYS HE'S A FRIEND.
&gt;&gt; BUT YOU DON'T KNOW WHO HE IS?

00:04:46.652 --> 00:04:51.758
&gt;&gt; NO, MA'AM.
&gt;&gt; OKAY.

00:04:51.758 --> 00:04:57.897
&gt;&gt; HE'S TELLING ME -- I'VE GOT
TO STOP TALKING TO YOU.

00:04:57.897 --> 00:05:01.033
&gt;&gt; OKAY.
I CAN STAY ON THE PHONE JUST TO

00:05:01.033 --> 00:05:04.637
MAKE SURE EVERYTHING IS OKAY.
&gt;&gt; NO, HE WANTS ME TO GET THE

00:05:04.637 --> 00:05:07.974
HELL OFF THE PHONE, OKAY?
&gt;&gt; OKAY.

00:05:07.974 --> 00:05:12.812
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.
&gt;&gt; OKAY, BYE.

00:05:12.812 --> 00:05:15.481
&gt;&gt; Reporter: IN AN INTERVIEW
WITH INVESTIGATORS AFTER HIS

00:05:15.481 --> 00:05:18.518
ARREST, DAVID DePAPE WAS ASKED
WHY HE HIT PAUL PELOSI WITH THE

00:05:18.518 --> 00:05:23.122
HAMMER EVENTUALLY AT THE END OF
THAT, YOU KNOW, ENCOUNTER.

00:05:23.122 --> 00:05:26.659
HE SAID HE DIDN'T WANT TO
SURRENDER, AND THAT HE NEEDED TO

00:05:26.659 --> 00:05:30.563
GO THROUGH HIM, BECAUSE HE WAS
THERE TO FIGHT EVIL.

00:05:30.563 --> 00:05:32.999
ALISON?
&gt;&gt; THE VIDEO IS INCREDIBLE.

00:05:32.999 --> 00:05:36.569
HEARING THAT CALL TO 911 AND
PAUL PELOSI SPEAKING IN CODE AND

00:05:36.569 --> 00:05:40.807
NOT KNOWING EXACTLY IF THE
POLICE ARE COMING OR WHAT TO DO,

00:05:40.807 --> 00:05:43.843
IT'S ALL JUST JAW DROPPING.
THANK YOU VERY MUCH FOR THE

00:05:43.843 --> 00:05:45.278
REPORTING.

